      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `bf01ea819f9743a048b8d31c13e599aafc0c8d790b670ca78120780e712be9b3--recorded-crime-offenders-2010-11-cube-2-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Offenders (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010-11\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 13 of 13\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | b58c67ca8ba7e95fc980df7fab69adc18d61b09f20b4e654c2b456472e3627f8 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 645c58e09023e90862d53f4bcf5887d0a4a1dea297846081214c17d7f0d33520 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 601e3d5b85bb739598c7d478bae6045a7461f1655a86e8c695df4cc601c76c76 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 1846c64716f9322112b3860e587c0a9b6564f332fa1008c1e4c7c18baa4e14e8 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | acbfcce20c5ff4934c681aff07c4ff8ccb0663b9624b5e664e6de254e6b3665b | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 2f95f166bdece56d45342f8f6606e3be21dac25c764f7646f65f42f099aed765 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 9a1074e519baa08ba46e1eff81bbcdf38dafdc54862cd1db933bf82bb221c33d | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | af8d6b4291f8e97114dcbc7f48a83ac7a573865c6612cee191f85f38cf674a45 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | a8c3de0c1435e23a858769ba271bd76a71b3ce460338ca5b5c833e4c72ed3fe6 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 45fb60977af54be8b248d752ddfba8bc48c038b185545945e4a8d7dfb38a8aa4 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 2c6081e3336ee54e533e553e43b5844c42afde853d07cfd94f17aca77d29ff94 | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 36497c9cb8c30ac0e50f4e08201ea4a6374a2007d8750e1a9ab10133afb716bd | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | e94ce6d57458956d8be5021738668ede51241cd67f631c3d5a1565146ac7a7e4 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionar